  nextDialogue: {fileID: 0}
  dialogues:
  - speaker: 0
    text: When the lights come back on, the two corpses have fused together.
    triggerEvents: []
    sounds: []
  - speaker: 0
    text: "You feel there\u2019s no way to separate them now."
    triggerEvents: []
    sounds: []
  - speaker: 2
    text: "\u201CThat was terrifying \u2014 where did you go when the power went
      out?\u201D"
    triggerEvents: []
    sounds: []
  - speaker: 0
    text: She looks a little angry.
    triggerEvents: []
    sounds: []
  - speaker: 2
    text: "\u201CI nearly thought I was a goner.\u201D"
    triggerEvents: []
    sounds: []
  - speaker: 1
    text: "\u201CUh... sorry.\u201D"
    triggerEvents: []
    sounds: []
  - speaker: 1
    text: "\u201CI backed into the corner.\u201D"
    triggerEvents: []
    sounds: []
  - speaker: 2
    text: "\u201C...Alright, what do we do now?\u201D"
    triggerEvents: []
    sounds: []
  - speaker: 2
    text: "\u201CCan you separate them?\u201D"
    triggerEvents: []
    sounds: []
  - speaker: 1
    text: "\u201CI have no idea.\u201D"
    triggerEvents: []
    sounds: []
  - speaker: 2
    text: "\u201CThen you know what to do.\u201D"
    triggerEvents: []
    sounds: []
  triggerEventStructs: []
